  "reference": "2 Mambo Ya Nyakati 17",
  "verseCount": 19,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "17",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2CH 17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "17",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Yehoshafati mwanawe alitawala mahali pa baba yake Asa, akajiimarisha dhidi ya Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aliweka majeshi katika miji yote ya Yuda yenye ngome, na katika maeneo mengine ya Yuda, na katika miji ya Efraimu ambayo Asa baba yake aliiteka akaweka askari walinzi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi-Mungu alikuwa pamoja na Yehoshafati kwa sababu alifuata njia za awali za baba yake, na wala hakumwabudu Baali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye alimtafuta Mungu wa baba yake na kuzitii amri zake, wala hakufuata matendo ya watu wa Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi-Mungu, aliuimarisha ufalme wa Yuda mikononi mwa Yehoshafati, nao watu wote wakamletea zawadi, akatajirika sana na kuheshimika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alipenda sana moyoni kumtumikia Mwenyezi-Mungu, na zaidi ya hayo, alipaharibu mahali pote pa kuabudia miungu mingine na sanamu za Ashera, mungu wa kike, nchini Yuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mnamo mwaka wa tatu wa utawala wake, Yehoshafati aliwatuma maofisa wafuatao wakafundishe katika miji ya Yuda: Ben-haili, Obadia, Zekaria, Nethaneli na Mikaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walawi tisa na Makuhani wawili waliandamana nao. Walawi hao walikuwa Shemaya, Nethania, Zebadia, Asaheli, Shemiramothi, Yehonathani, Adoniya, Tobia na Tob-adoniya; na makuhani walikuwa Elishama na Yehoramu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walikichukua kitabu cha sheria ya Mwenyezi-Mungu, wakazunguka nacho katika miji yote ya Yuda wakifundisha watu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi-Mungu alizitia hofu falme zote jirani na Yuda, zikaogopa kupigana vita na Yehoshafati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baadhi ya Wafilisti walimletea Yehoshafati zawadi pamoja na fedha nyingi, na Waarabu wengine nao wakamletea kondoo madume 7,700, na mabeberu 7,700. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa hiyo Yehoshafati aliendelea kuwa mkuu zaidi. Alijenga ngome na miji yenye ghala, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kwa hiyo alikuwa na ghala kubwa katika miji ya Yuda. Huko Yerusalemu, aliweka askari wa jeshi mashujaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hii ndiyo orodha yao kulingana na koo za baba zao: Adna alikuwa kamanda wa vikosi vya askari 1,000 wa kabila la Yuda. Chini yake, kulikuwa na askari laki tatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wa pili katika cheo alikuwa kamanda Yehohanani, akiwa na askari 280,000, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na wa tatu alikuwa Amasia mwana wa Zikri, akiwa na askari mashujaa 200,000. Amasia alijitolea kwa hiari kumtumikia Mwenyezi-Mungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kamanda wa vikosi vya askari, waliotoka katika kabila la Benyamini alikuwa Eliada, mtu shupavu, naye alikuwa na askari 200,000, wenye nyuta na ngao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wa pili alikuwa Yehozabadi, aliyekuwa na askari 180,000 waliojiandaa tayari kwa vita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Watu wote hao walimhudumia mfalme huko Yerusalemu; na zaidi ya hayo, mfalme aliweka askari wengine katika miji ile mingine yenye ngome kote nchini Yuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
